  briefing: Battlegroup 7 has been ordered to conduct anti-piracy patrols in sector
    Gamma. There have been increased reports of trader and law enforcement vessels
    being engaged by unknown hostiles.
  afterActionReport: Hostile vessel debris does not match any known ship configuration.
